  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoration of Burle Marx Patios</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the 10 year Capital Master Plan, the renovation project of the Burle Marx Patios is considered critical. The technical diagnostic note revealed that the constant water leakage is damaging the structure of the building and needs to be addressed urgently. 

In addition, the artistic component of the restauration of the patios is being handled in close cooperation with Brazil and Morocco Permanent Delegations. 

And a larger fundraising campaign for the project has been initiated.</narrative>
  </description>
